THIRD-PARTY DATA

This project downloads the Banking77 dataset at runtime for demonstration
purposes.

  Banking77 — PolyAI et al., "Efficient Intent Detection with Dual Sentence
  Encoders", Data 2021 / https://github.com/PolyAI-LDN/task-specific-datasets
  Licensed under CC BY 4.0. 10,003 real customer service queries annotated
  into 77 banking intents. Not redistributed in this repository; fetched from
  the URL in src/data/datasets.py.

  Cited as: Casanueva et al., "Efficient Intent Detection with Dual Sentence
  Encoders", 2020. arXiv:2004.13651

THIRD-PARTY MODELS

  sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 — Apache 2.0, downloaded at runtime
  from the Hugging Face Hub.

  Ollama models (e.g. qwen3) are the operator's responsibility under their own
  licences.
